 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "Q0343",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**Q0343** · question\n\nCan CLSS 5D Southworth-Hawkins orbital phase-space clustering on multi-station (>=3 stations, >=2 countries) GMN orbits (2018-2026) certify an uncatalogued >=15-member meteor shower cluster (D_SH<0.10 internal, D_SH>=0.20 and >5 deg from all 2,192 streamfulldata2026.txt rows, >5 sigma over 400 shuffled controls) plus a 6h outburst (p1) and >=3-year working-list recurrence (p2)?",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "F0343_MDC",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**F0343_MDC** · fact\n\nstreamfulldata2026.txt (updated 2026-10-19 20:00 UTC, sha256 08409111...) has 2,192 rows (1,999 with explicit orbits, 193 radiant-only, 430 single-year s=0 working-list entries); check_meteor_cluster.py --selftest passes POS/NEG calibration on 2018 Geminids and sporadics",
   "x": 420,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2"
  },
  {
   "id": "H0343_L1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**H0343_L1** · hypothesis\n\nLens 1 (constructor): 5D D_SH ball & medoid-clique extraction on unassigned (IAU=-1) >=3-station >=2-country GMN orbits pre-screened at D_SH>=0.22 and radiant sep >6 deg from all MDC entries will isolate >=1 new >=15-member shower cluster and a >=10-meteor 6h outburst (p1)",
   "x": 420,
   "y": 220,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "H0343_L2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**H0343_L2** · hypothesis\n\nLens 2 (optimizer): Multi-year template matching of single-year working-list (s=0) showers in streamfulldata2026.txt across 2019-2026 GMN multi-station orbits will certify >=3-year annual recurrence with D_SH<0.10 (p2) and run the 400-control background null test",
   "x": 420,
   "y": 440,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "E0343_L2_SINGLE_YR_ONLY",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "✗ **E0343_L2_SINGLE_YR_ONLY** · experiment\n\nSingle-year-only clustering on unassigned trajectories requiring n_countries>=2 per meteor and D_SH>=0.25 from all 2192 MDC rows\n\n*why dead:* Requiring both n_countries>=2 per meteor and D_SH>=0.25 within a single calendar year yields max cluster size <15; multi-year aggregation across 2021-2026 yields 28 clusters >=15 with 7 beating all 400 controls at >5 sigma.",
   "x": 840,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "E0343_L2_AUDIT",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**E0343_L2_AUDIT** · experiment\n\naudit_p2_and_independent_search.py (sha256 be251009...): scanned 1,772,720 multi-station GMN rows (2018-2026) against 2,192 MDC rows (1,999 explicit + 171 radiant-derived Keplerian orbits)",
   "x": 840,
   "y": 220,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "R0343_L2_P2_AND_INDEP",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**R0343_L2_P2_AND_INDEP** · result\n\nCertified 17 single-year MDC working-list showers with multi-year GMN recurrence (p2, D_SH<0.06, top M2025-S1 6 yrs N=107 D_SH=0.0023 Z=6.18sigma, KCA #793 6 yrs N=60 D_SH=0.0194 Z=48.76sigma) and 7 independent unassigned multi-country clusters >=15 (D_SH>=0.268, rad_sep>11.1 deg, >5 sigma over 400 controls; top Indep #1 N=15 D_SH_MDC=0.3308 Z=9.21sigma)",
   "x": 1260,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "E0343_L1_PER_WING_6H",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "✗ **E0343_L1_PER_WING_6H** · experiment\n\nUnscreened 6h outburst scan on unassigned trajectories near sol_lon 125-141 deg (RA 23-52 deg, Dec +55..+62 deg, Vg 56-59 km/s)\n\n*why dead:* Although unassigned (IAU=-1) in GMN with N=18-27 per 6h window and catalog D_SH=0.18-0.22, these clusters lie in the dispersed eccentric wing of PER #7 and ZCS #444 and fail strict D_SH>=0.25 and radiant sep >10 deg gates.",
   "x": 840,
   "y": 440,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
   "id": "E0343_L1_DISCOVERY",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**E0343_L1_DISCOVERY** · experiment\n\ndiscover_new_showers.py (sha256 d5ece6f7...): CLSS Stage II-IV metric-ball & seam-surgery search across 193,724 MDC-isolated (D_SH>=0.25, rad_sep>8 deg) high-quality multi-station GMN orbits + 400-control null verification",
   "x": 840,
   "y": 660,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "3"
  },
  {
   "id": "R0343_L1_MAIN_AND_P1",
