   "text": "**R0343_L1_MAIN_AND_P1** · result\n\nCertified 4 Main clusters (M2_Hercules N=20 max_D_SH=0.0491 max_pw=0.0829 min_MDC_D_SH=0.3539 rad_sep=11.76 deg 7 countries Z=26.81sigma; M1_Cepheus_Core N=15 max_D_SH=0.0468 min_MDC_D_SH=0.2766 rad_sep=19.94 deg 13 countries Z=33.31sigma; M1_Cepheus_MC N=15 100% per-meteor n_countries>=2 min_MDC_D_SH=0.2829 Z=13.31sigma; M3_Camelopardalis N=16 max_D_SH=0.0371 min_MDC_D_SH=0.3151 Z=45.84sigma) and p1 6h outburst (2025-Sep-01 N=10 in 4.84h max_D_SH=0.0619 min_MDC_D_SH=0.2521 rad_sep=20.65 deg 6 countries Z=10.68sigma), all beating 400/400 controls",
